from its mashed up genre to its Western  setting yet it never overwhelms the  story at its core is always centered on  its four heroines and the surprising  stirring and even sublime ways they  survive their circumstances check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite stuff for coming soon subscribe  to our YouTube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

